# The HTTP form of a proto contract: the HTTP variation point attached to a
# service that already has the gRPC one, serving the same contract over HTTP.
# Besides the HTTP form, the example adds AddItem and ListItems with an
# in-memory store (a service in Todo.Application/Services, the store in
# src/Infrastructure/Memory) so it shows a path parameter, 201, 404, 409, and a
# deprecated method; those commands are why the gRPC endpoint, its scenarios,
# and the module's projects change.
base library/architecture/dotnet/vp-grpc-api-in-dotnet.skill/examples
examples examples-proto
change src/App/App.Host/Program.cs
change src/App/App.Host/App.Host.csproj
change Directory.Packages.props
change Todo.slnx
change Makefile
change README.md
change .gitignore
change docs/integration/api/todo/todo.proto
change src/App/App.Host/Api/Grpc/Endpoint/ItemsHandler.cs
change src/App/App.Host.Tests/features/Grpc/Items.feature
change src/App/App.Host.Tests/Steps/Grpc/ItemsServiceSteps.cs
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Application/Todo.Application.csproj
change src/Modules/Todo/Todo.Domain/Errors/TodoErrors.cs
